[00:00.370]Sakura when I see it all hit the ground
{"当樱花纷飞飘落满地时"}
[00:06.030]My heart gets weak
{"我的心变得脆弱"}
[00:06.660]'Cause that dream that you and I had made
{"因为你我曾共同编织的梦想"}
[00:10.840]Is still so clear in me
{"在我心中依然清晰如昨"}
[00:13.410]And I wonder if that day will come
{"我不断思索那一天会否到来"}
[00:17.470]Where we could make it real
{"我们能将梦想化为现实"}
[00:20.910]Baby will I ever see you
{"亲爱的我能否再见到你"}
[00:25.350]Sakura will I breathe again
{"樱花啊我能否重获呼吸"}
[00:47.740]I keep imagining you in front of me
{"眼前总浮现你的幻影"}
[01:04.340]Everywhere I go, I find
{"无论走到何处都会发现"}
[01:07.370]Myself back in time with you
{"自己又回到与你共度的时光里"}
[01:11.420]Can't help remembering
{"忍不住反复回忆"}
[01:13.980]And I keep looking out in my window
{"我仍时常凝望窗外"}
[01:16.680]Hoping you would come home
{"期盼着你归来的身影"}
[01:20.240]Even though we said it was over
{"即使我们说过就此结束"}
[01:24.550]I can still hear your voice
{"耳畔仍回荡你的声音"}
[01:26.870]I try to tell you that I'm doing alright
{"试图告诉你我过得不错"}
[01:29.670]Even though my heart is feeling so tight
{"尽管心口阵阵发紧作痛"}
[01:33.640]But I'm feeling so alone in this
{"但此刻感到如此孤独"}
[01:36.950]And life's not right without you
{"没有你生命失去色彩"}
[01:40.580]Each day it gets harder and
{"日子一天比一天难熬"}
[01:44.050]I wish that I could say I love you
{"多想能再次说出我爱你"}
[01:47.010]All over again
{"从头再来一遍"}
[01:50.120]Can't you see
{"难道你看不见"}
[01:52.740]What we used to be
{"我们曾经的模样"}
